tellraw @a {"text": "Type is cast in an adjustable mould from a lead-tin-antimony alloy that fills the matrix", "color": "gray"}
tellraw @a {"text": "cleanly. Pages are composed in a forme, inked with leather balls, and the screw press", "color": "gray"}
tellraw @a {"text": "forces damp paper onto the type. A trained shop printed about 250 sheets an hour.", "color": "gray"}
